WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.082
Hello, everyone! I'm Mr. Jake. Welcome to Online A two, Book one.

2
00:00:06.382 --> 00:00:09.652
Hi! I'm Sreypich. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:09.952 --> 00:00:16.401
Unit eighteen: Smart Food Choices. In this unit, you will talk about healthy food choices.

4
00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:18.244
Healthy.

5
00:00:18.944 --> 00:00:20.711
Healthy means good for your body.

6
00:00:21.011 --> 00:00:22.685
Fruit is a healthy snack.

7
00:00:23.385 --> 00:00:26.165
Your turn. Say: Healthy.

8
00:00:28.865 --> 00:00:29.739
Healthy.

9
00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:31.867
Junk food.

10
00:00:32.567 --> 00:00:36.111
Junk food means food with lots of fat, salt or sugar.

11
00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:38.434
Too much junk food is bad for you.

12
00:00:39.134 --> 00:00:42.239
Your turn. Say: Junk food.

13
00:00:44.939 --> 00:00:45.893
Junk food.

14
00:00:46.883 --> 00:00:47.733
Sugar.

15
00:00:48.433 --> 00:00:50.363
Sugar means a sweet white powder.

16
00:00:50.663 --> 00:00:52.408
Soda has a lot of sugar.

17
00:00:53.108 --> 00:00:55.504
Your turn. Say: Sugar.

18
00:00:58.204 --> 00:00:59.031
Sugar.

19
00:01:00.017 --> 00:01:01.064
Vegetables.

20
00:01:01.764 --> 00:01:04.797
Vegetables means plants we eat, like beans and carrots.

21
00:01:05.097 --> 00:01:06.853
Eat vegetables every day.

22
00:01:07.553 --> 00:01:09.822
Your turn. Say: Vegetables.

23
00:01:12.522 --> 00:01:13.628
Vegetables.

24
00:01:14.617 --> 00:01:15.478
Protein.

25
00:01:16.178 --> 00:01:19.838
Protein means food that helps you grow, like fish, eggs and beans.

26
00:01:20.138 --> 00:01:21.708
Fish is full of protein.

27
00:01:22.408 --> 00:01:24.968
Your turn. Say: Protein.

28
00:01:27.668 --> 00:01:28.541
Protein.

29
00:01:29.550 --> 00:01:30.354
Water.

30
00:01:31.054 --> 00:01:33.344
Water means the best drink for your body.

31
00:01:33.644 --> 00:01:35.713
I drink eight glasses of water a day.

32
00:01:36.413 --> 00:01:38.752
Your turn. Say: Water.

33
00:01:41.452 --> 00:01:42.279
Water.

34
00:01:43.283 --> 00:01:44.168
Choose.

35
00:01:44.868 --> 00:01:47.112
Choose means to pick one thing from many.

36
00:01:47.412 --> 00:01:49.028
I choose fruit for dessert.

37
00:01:49.728 --> 00:01:52.392
Your turn. Say: Choose.

38
00:01:55.092 --> 00:01:55.919
Choose.

39
00:01:56.917 --> 00:01:57.790
Balanced.

40
00:01:58.490 --> 00:02:01.070
Balanced means with the right amount of each thing.

41
00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:03.312
A balanced meal keeps you strong.

42
00:02:04.012 --> 00:02:06.687
Your turn. Say: Balanced.

43
00:02:09.387 --> 00:02:10.237
Balanced.

44
00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:13.482
Now let's listen to a conversation.

45
00:02:13.782 --> 00:02:16.304
Sreypich, what did you have for lunch?

46
00:02:17.617 --> 00:02:21.128
Rice, fish and vegetables. A balanced meal!

47
00:02:22.417 --> 00:02:24.454
Great! Do you drink soda?

48
00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:28.449
Not often. I drink water instead of soda.

49
00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:31.123
What about snacks?

50
00:02:32.417 --> 00:02:34.660
I choose fruit instead of sweets.

51
00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:38.832
Grammar focus: Instead of plus noun.

52
00:02:39.132 --> 00:02:40.772
I drink water instead of soda.

53
00:02:41.072 --> 00:02:45.071
'Instead of' means 'in place of'. After it, use a noun or a verb with -ing.

54
00:02:46.083 --> 00:02:48.631
Now read and listen. A Smart Plate.

55
00:02:48.931 --> 00:02:51.813
A balanced meal has vegetables, protein and rice.

56
00:02:53.117 --> 00:02:56.161
Junk food has lots of sugar, salt and fat.

57
00:02:57.450 --> 00:03:00.483
It tastes good, but it isn't healthy every day.

58
00:03:01.783 --> 00:03:04.955
I choose water instead of soda and fruit instead of sweets.

59
00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:09.805
Smart food choices give me energy for school and sport.

60
00:03:11.117 --> 00:03:13.746
Quiz time! Choose the correct answer.

61
00:03:14.046 --> 00:03:15.709
I drink water blank soda.

62
00:03:16.009 --> 00:03:19.058
A, instead of. B, because of. C, out of.

63
00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:24.852
The answer is A: instead of.

64
00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:29.766
Food with lots of fat, salt or sugar is blank.

65
00:03:30.066 --> 00:03:34.230
A, junk food. B, protein. C, vegetables.

66
00:03:38.217 --> 00:03:40.727
The answer is A: junk food.

67
00:03:42.217 --> 00:03:44.379
Fish, eggs and beans are full of blank.

68
00:03:44.679 --> 00:03:47.891
A, protein. B, sugar. C, water.

69
00:03:51.883 --> 00:03:54.614
The answer is A: protein.

70
00:03:56.117 --> 00:03:59.698
Now it's your turn to speak. What healthy choice can you make today?

71
00:04:04.998 --> 00:04:09.493
Today I can drink water instead of soda, and I can eat a banana instead of crisps.

72
00:04:09.793 --> 00:04:11.549
Excellent answer, Sreypich!

73
00:04:12.550 --> 00:04:16.549
Great work today! You learned eight new words and instead of plus noun.

74
00:04:16.849 --> 00:04:21.313
Today's value is healthy living. Choose healthy food and drink lots of water.

75
00:04:21.613 --> 00:04:23.963
See you in Unit nineteen. Goodbye!

76
00:04:24.263 --> 00:04:26.927
Thank you, Mr. Jake! Bye, everyone!

